>>> testCase "DEFER_MEMBER function with map populated by another coroutine"
>>> setupFile ~/targetPackage/main.petrol
WORK_VAR @myMap = (MAP [FIELDS []])
SCHED {
    PRINT("Setting field")
    SET_MEMBER(myMap, "a", 123)
}
WORK_VAR @value = (DEFER_MEMBER(myMap, "a", "Waiting for field"))
PRINT("Deferred field")
PRINT(value)
>>> expectPrint
Deferred field
Setting field
123
=========================
>>> testCase "DEFER_MEMBER function with list populated by another coroutine"
